t in the pose! If it's okay, may I request another illustration?\n\nThis time I would be happy if I could make a request for an illustration for my character <Estelle>.\n\nEstelle: https://www.deviantart.com/stash/216wkio0653j\n\nPlease view the character references from the URL above.\n\nPlease color the sclera of her eyes black, not white. She is a girl with a sociable personality but gives off an air of being sinister. She has the features of a spider.\n\nI toggled \"NSFW\" on in the settings, and I'd be happy if a suggestive, sexy illustration without too much exposure could be drawn. I'll leave the composition up to you. Thank you very much for your consideration.", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mikaduki1224/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3927844, "client_id": 53759, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8408363b/uploads/origins/138b00e0-d913-46d3-8696-f5073447877e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ece87b992ce5a8e565ad0fb9ac5b88c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8408363b/uploads/origins/138b00e0-d913-46d3-8696-f5073447877e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ece87b992ce5a8e565ad0fb9ac5b88c, https://si.imgix.net/8408363b/uploads/origins/138b00e0-d913-46d3-8696-f5073447877e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=539faa17f9a6f6ef0265666c4244bd5d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8408363b/uploads/origins/138b00e0-d913-46d3-8696-f5073447877e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd2b2d0117e16f0d7090fa84a769d3ec 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8408363b/uploads/origins/138b00e0-d913-46d3-8696-f5073447877e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fi